  "9e52aec1-7204-42c8-9691-5616ba5a0a70"],
 StyleBox[" (9 DOF).",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The temperature gradient can exert a net torque on a non-symmetric body:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"92dea785-86e0-48b0-9e68-63863e579660"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Tau]",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
