  FontColor->GrayLevel[0.3]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["f", 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2aca74a2-e5fc-4d37-a064-f7ba380b8941"],
 StyleBox[" has more DOF than the symmetric count (last column). The assumed \
symmetry of ",
